WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:10,650
From now on, all fire artists will stop

2
00:00:17,170 --> 00:00:18,170
Don’t seek stability from power

3
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:19,570
Move what you see first

4
00:00:19,570 --> 00:00:22,690
Don't think about emptying it and moving from house to house again, Captain Lu

5
00:00:23,010 --> 00:00:24,810
Then we'll go to the last two rows of classes and wait.

6
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:26,930
You and I have not contributed anything until now

7
00:00:27,130 --> 00:00:28,690
Captain Lu has always been busy

8
00:00:29,210 --> 00:00:32,410
I suggest you hurry up and get this batch of things.

9
00:00:32,410 --> 00:00:34,330
Let K1 base get all supplies first

10
00:00:34,330 --> 00:00:35,810
After the move is completed, we will all share it together.

11
00:00:36,090 --> 00:00:38,210
I can trust Captain Lu’s character.

12
00:00:38,910 --> 00:00:40,390
You must believe it too, right?

13
00:00:40,950 --> 00:00:43,300
What happened to him today?

14
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:46,810
You've been thinking about me like this, I'll go first
